   "id": "d5fa4679",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Target balance:** the dataset is close to balanced — about 54% of marriages in this sample were not recorded as divorced vs. 46% that were. That's good news for modeling: we don't need resampling (SMOTE, class weighting, etc.) just to get a classifier to predict both classes, though we'll still watch precision/recall per class rather than relying on accuracy alone."
   ]
  },
